1a:T562,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Product","@id":"https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-homestar-5#product","name":"BLUETTI Homestar 5 Solution","url":"https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-homestar-5","image":["https://batteriq.com/products/bluetti/bluetti-homestar-5.webp"],"description":"The Bluetti Homestar 5 solution pairs a 3.68kW inverter with 5kWh of LiFePO4 battery energy storage for home backup in Kenya. The larger sibling of the Homestar 3, for homes that need more power and longer runtime through KPLC outages. Switches over automatically when the grid drops and recharges from mains or solar.","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"BLUETTI"},"category":"Solar Home Systems","sku":"BLUETTI-HOMESTAR-5","additionalProperty":[{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Ac Output","value":"3.68kW Inverter"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Capacity","value":"5kWh Battery"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Chemistry","value":"LFP (LiFePO4)"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Type","value":"3.68kW Inverter + 5kWh Battery Storage"}],"offers":{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://batteriq.com/bluetti/bluetti-homestar-5","priceCurrency":"KES","price":161500,"priceValidUntil":"2027-11-16","itemCondition":"https://schema.org/NewCondition","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","seller":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://batteriq.com/#organization","name":"Batteriq"}}}1b:T765,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much is the Homestar 5 Solution in Kenya?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Homestar 5 Solution costs KES 161,500 at Batteriq, Kenya's authorised BLUETTI dealer. You can pay instantly with M-Pesa or by Visa/Mastercard at checkout. It is covered by a 24-month warranty."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the Homestar 5 Solution available in Nairobi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — the Homestar 5 Solution is in stock and ready to ship. We deliver across Nairobi and ship nationwide to all 47 counties, and you will get an official eTIMS KRA invoice with your order."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the Homestar 5 Solution genuine and covered by warranty?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Batteriq is Kenya's authorised BLUETTI dealer, so every unit is genuine stock supported locally. It is covered by a 24-month warranty. Keep your Batteriq receipt as proof of purchase for any warranty claim."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What can the BLUETTI Homestar 5 Solution run in a Kenyan home?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"With 5,000 Wh, the BLUETTI Homestar 5 Solution can run a fridge (150 W) for approximately 28 hours, a TV (100 W) for approximately 43 hours, a Wi-Fi router (15 W) for approximately 283 hours and lights (50 W) for approximately 85 hours, each on its own. These are approximate (capacity × 0.85 ÷ watts). Keep the total load under its 3.68kW Inverter AC output. Send us your appliance list on WhatsApp and we will size it for you."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which solar panels work with the BLUETTI Homestar 5 Solution?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Message us on WhatsApp with your setup and we will confirm which of our solar panels and cables work with the BLUETTI Homestar 5 Solution."}}]}20:{"size":20}
